{"id":"gamefreak-staff-62","kind":"blog","title":"【工作日志】2008年白色情人节蛋糕祭","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2008-03-14","publication":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · ケーキ祭り","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-staff/entry-62/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_legacy_blog","summary":"男性员工送来各式回礼蛋糕，女员工们兴奋挑选，现场还出现了牛主题蛋糕。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","Game Freak 员工","GF介绍","日记","宝可梦","招聘","更新通知","未分类"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"晴れたり時々曇ったり · ケーキ祭り","url":"http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=62","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20130808162750/http://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/staff/?p=62","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div data-gf-language-panel=\"zh-CN\">\n我是カニ子（蟹子）。<br>\n\n今天是白色情人节呢。\n\n刚才收到了男性员工送的回礼蛋糕！\n\n话虽如此，其实我并没有送情人节巧克力，<br>\n\n但那位对蛋糕很在行的男性员工每年都会买蛋糕来。<br>\n\n从零创造出原本不存在之物的炼金术……！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_05-71fde094.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_05-71fde094.jpg\" alt=\"ケーキと女性スタッフ\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\n虽然蛋糕太多，让人挑花了眼，但女员工们的兴奋度正在不断上升。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_02-5d0b5c2c.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_02-5d0b5c2c.jpg\" alt=\"ケーキ\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\n这个好像是以牛为主题的蛋糕。旁边那个是蛋糕卷。<br>\n\n好吃又可爱——。\n\n谢谢款待！\n\n<br>\n</div>\n\n<div data-gf-language-panel=\"ja\" hidden>\nカニ子です。<br>\n\n今日はホワイトデーですね。\n\nさっき男性スタッフからお返しのケーキを貰いました！\n\nといっても、私は実はバレンタインチョコをあげていないのですが、<br>\n\nケーキに詳しい男性スタッフが毎年ケーキを買ってきてくれるのです。<br>\n\nゼロから有を生み出す錬金術…！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_05-71fde094.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_05-71fde094.jpg\" alt=\"ケーキと女性スタッフ\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\nいっぱいあって迷っちゃうけど、女性陣のテンション上がり中です。\n\n<figure class=\"gf-legacy-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_02-5d0b5c2c.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-legacy/staff/62/kani_080314_02-5d0b5c2c.jpg\" alt=\"ケーキ\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></figure><br>\n\nこれは牛をモチーフにしたケーキみたい。隣のはロールケーキです。<br>\n\nうまかわいー。\n\nごちそうさまでした！\n\n<br>\n</div>","markdown_ja":null}}